[{"type":"message","user":"U022E2B9KRD","text":"\u003c@U022E2B9KRD\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626864268.207700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"478440DA-9319-49C8-829D-826EAD22A9DA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"前にパルメジャーノじゃなくて、ペコリーノで作ってみたことあったけど、ちょっと香りが好みではなかったですね。","ts":"1626864170.207500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IQw/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7b5a9b7-9537-43bc-baec-1f5887456b34","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"ワインにもよると思いますけど、酸味はほとんど残らず香りが残る感じです\n甘い白ワインだと結構味が変わってくるかもしれないしれない","ts":"1626862999.205100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U01D9BALEKU","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"wakarite","count":1,"users":["UGHD6GP16"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ip31"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d531c94f-139f-4813-8a2a-e539d4b8fec4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"酸味が入るのはどうなんだろ？（好みって書いてあるけど）","ts":"1626862877.203200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oqn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ec62326-0a29-432e-87bb-c5b62ca4064f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"白ワインいれるレシピは初めて目にしました","ts":"1626862860.202600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kd1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af91fee3-496f-4ce1-a213-e4c50853d3f5","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"たぶん、基本同じ感じだと思います！\nパンチェッタかベーコンかの違いくらいじゃないでしょうか？\n\n美味しいですよね:spaghetti:","ts":"1626862560.202000","edited":{"user":"UEACRCY0Z","ts":"1626862622.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7hJHm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c7842b1-3fcf-4e06-877d-27f256e179dc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"（今日のやつはチーズ削るの途中でめんどくなって少なめにしたらああなった）","ts":"1626862410.201200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cBP9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ea2f992-0dd3-4962-b467-7ad6b03e02bb","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"手早く作れて旨いんですよね　オススメです","ts":"1626862147.200400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UGHD6GP16","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sjeN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6af14ea-b639-4f77-9e48-0614e1239a3a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"うちで作るカルボナーラはたぶんクラシックなレシピですね\n1. ベーコン炒めて乳化させる\n2. 全卵に粉胡椒とパルミジャーノチーズをたくさんいれて混ぜる\n3. パスタを(1)と和えてからさらに(2)と和える\n4. 盛りつけて削る胡椒をたくさんかける\n硬さはチーズの量で調節します","ts":"1626862101.199500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rfgLT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2decff52-20f1-41f1-b183-8c96c9c0ac97","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"ぼくの好きなカルボナーラのレシピ\n\u003chttp://pastalabo.cocolog-nifty.com/blog/2005/05/2_de9a.html\u003e","ts":"1626860574.194900","attachments":[{"fallback":"パスタレシピ研究会: カルボナーラ：ローマ風全卵タイプ2 - パスタレシピ研究会","id":1,"title":"カルボナーラ：ローマ風全卵タイプ2 - パスタレシピ研究会","title_link":"http://pastalabo.cocolog-nifty.com/blog/2005/05/2_de9a.html","text":"パスタレシピ：カルボナーラ系パスタ：スパゲッティ5/21（土）カルボナーラ：ローマ風カルボナーラ2自己評価：★★★★★手軽度合：★★★☆☆家族評価：★★★★☆今日は2品つくった。...","thumb_url":"http://pastalabo.cocolog-nifty.com/blog/images/carbonara7_thumb.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"パスタレシピ研究会","thumb_width":300,"thumb_height":225,"from_url":"http://pastalabo.cocolog-nifty.com/blog/2005/05/2_de9a.html","original_url":"http://pastalabo.cocolog-nifty.com/blog/2005/05/2_de9a.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wnr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2c6328e-0500-4efb-b1d7-fb2fa0c5f5bc","type":"message","user":"UEACRCY0Z","text":"パンチェッタは生ハムという言葉を真似てか、日本では生ベーコンと言われたりしますねー","ts":"1626860350.194200","edited":{"user":"UEACRCY0Z","ts":"1626860384.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5AmO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A61F49C9-426F-42A4-86FA-215490D83B18","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"購入の時のポイントは、香り（どちらかというと臭みかな）と塩味の強さが好みかどうかですね。","ts":"1626857850.192000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3a1N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9B3DF3C8-F97B-43D6-B119-470F463C2CF8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"脂身の多い塩漬けって感じですよね\n個人で作る人だと、香辛料も入れる人が多いイメージがあります","ts":"1626857642.189900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UEACRCY0Z","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tglP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36B793E1-EA28-4F0D-BF5B-BEFC52394561","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"豚バラのベーコンだったのか \u0026gt;パンチェッタ","ts":"1626857532.189800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PHA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75931606-C1DA-4B71-B9EE-12F98F4DEB07","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ブリ照り焼けました！","ts":"1626857474.188700","files":[{"id":"F028MP0JU4D","created":1626857464,"timestamp":1626857464,"name":"Image from iOS.jpg","title":"Image from iOS","mimetype":"image/jpeg","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"jpg","pretty_type":"JPEG","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":677720,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F028MP0JU4D/image_from_ios.jpg","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F028MP0JU4D/download/image_from_ios.jpg","original_h":3024,"original_w":40